"""fig4j_baseline_change_stats  -  Panel j

Computes
    Panel j: three views of the baseline-versus-change relation for each
    perturbation - naive baseline-vs-change correlation, the Oldham
    mean-vs-change correlation, and the regression of the perturbed value on
    baseline.

Inputs
    04_figures/fig.4  (staged read-only into the scratch mirror)

Output
    $FIG4_OUT/figures/fig.4/fig4_data/fig4j_baseline_change_stats.csv  (default $FIG4_OUT = 03_analysis/fig4/_scratch)
    reference copy: 04_figures/fig.4/fig4_data/fig4j_baseline_change_stats.csv

Statistical tests
    Pearson correlations (naive and Oldham), OLS of post on pre with the slope
    tested against 1, and the post/pre variance ratio.

Cohort
    n = 288.

Runs on a laptop
    yes - seconds on a laptop.

seed
    no random component

Rebuilt from execution-log cell
    a21cec10-f1a8-46d5-8aa0-553a33110bfc (frame fe47a03f-2d43-4fe0-a1c3-e0544839d822, 2026-09-21 19:21:24 UTC, conda env python, exit ok)
    the computation itself lives in 04_figures/fig.4/fig4.py; this cell authored it
    verbatim archive: recovered/fig4/fig4j_baseline_change_stats__cell_a21cec10.py
"""
